    {'name': 'Daidoji Harriers', 'clan': 'Crane', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'IH'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Covert operatives using dishonorable methods: sabotage, assassination, gaijin pepper. Founded in the ruins of Shiro Giji in 330. Exposed during the War of Silk and Steel, disbanded by Champion Doji Domotai. Requires Agility 4, Air 4, Craft: Explosive 3, Hunting (Traps) 3, Stealth 5, Knives 4. Must be Daidoji and recruited.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Move Like Shadows', 'effect': 'Lose only half Honor (rounded down) for dishonorable actions on behalf of the Crane. +1k1 bonus to rural trap damage (stacks with Scout techniques).'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Iron Feather', 'effect': 'In light/ashigaru/no armor, add Stealth Skill Rank to Armor TN.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Unforgiving Steel', 'effect': 'Attacking surprised/unaware foes also Dazes them. Cannot recover from Daze until next Reactions Stage. Daze recovery TN +5.'}]},
    {'name': 'Kakita Master Artisan', 'clan': 'Crane', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': [], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': "Secret techniques of artistic perfection passed down from the Empire's finest artists. Art so perfect it temporarily changes reality: mystifies shugenja. Requires Awareness 5, Void 5, chosen art at Rank 8+. If Kakita Artisan: must have Great Potential in chosen art. If not: must have Prodigy and Great Potential in one art skill.", 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': "The Master's Touch", 'effect': 'Chosen art roll (TN 40): success gives 5+ Glory and audience gains one bonus Void Point for 24 hours (two Void Points with 4+ Raises).'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Mastery Unbound', 'effect': '+2k0 to chosen art skill rolls. Select a third chosen art if trained as Kakita Artisan.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'The Perfect Art', 'effect': 'Once per month, spend 2 Void Points and roll (TN 50): success brings the art to life. Manifestation lasts a few minutes (one hour with 4 Raises). GM determines the helpful and extraordinary manifestation.'}]},
    {'name': 'Kenshinzen', 'clan': 'Crane', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'CR'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'The pinnacle of iaijutsu mastery. Monsters of single combat: impeccable technique and lethal aura. Entire consciousness devoted to the fast draw and perfection of the single strike. Requires Fire 4, Void 4, Iaijutsu 5, Lore: Bushido 4, Meditation 5. Must defeat a current Kenshinzen in a legal duel.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Drawing the Void', 'effect': 'In Center Stance, add +10 to Armor TN.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': "Kakita's Strength", 'effect': 'Assessment and Focus rolls in iaijutsu duels: dice explode on 9 as well as 10.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'A Single Moment', 'effect': 'If you make only one attack this Turn, the opponent you hit is Stunned until beginning of your next Turn.'}]},
    {'name': 'Aerie Falconer', 'clan': 'Crane', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': [], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Rank 2 (or 4). Replaces: Doji Courtier 2, Kakita Bushi 2, or Daidoji Iron Warrior 4. Requires: Animal Handling (Falcon) 3. Finest falconers in the Colonies: use birds as political tools and weapons.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Spirit of the Falcon', 'effect': 'When hunting with trained falcon, spending Void Point on Hunting adds half Animal Handling (Falcon) as bonus unkept dice. Verbal command as Free Action to send trained falcon to attack an enemy.'}]},
    {'name': 'Asahina Archers', 'clan': 'Crane', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Daidoji Iron Warrior 4 or Doji Magistrate 4. Requires: Air 3, Kyujutsu 5, must be Asahina or Daidoji.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'No Regrets', 'effect': 'Called Shots cost 1 less Raise (minimum 1). Add half Air (rounded down) as unkept dice to archery attacks.'}]},
    {'name': 'Asahina Artisans', 'clan': 'Crane', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Asahina Shugenja 3. Founded by Asahina Hake: use magic to create transitory but supremely memorable art through illusion.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': "Hake's Lesson", 'effect': 'When making Artisan Skill Roll, expend spell slots to add +2 per slot to total (Air slots add +3). Maximum slots equal to twice Insight Rank.'}]},
