    {'name': 'Ox Clan Vigilant', 'clan': 'Minor Clan', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['SE'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Morito Bushi 4', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Seek the Guilty', 'effect': 'When investigating someone for possible lawbreaking or Kolat activity, make a Contested Roll of Investigation (Interrogation) / Perception against the target’s Sincerity (Deceit) / Awareness. If you succeed and the target is actually guilty (GM’s judgment), gain +1k1 to all Intimidation rolls and attack rolls against that target for the next 24 hours.'}]},
