    {'name': 'Tortoise Guard', 'clan': 'Minor Clan', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'IH'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Kasuga Smuggler 4', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Path of One', 'effect': 'From their gaijin ancestors and commoner allies, the Tortoise Guards have learned that samurai Honor can be a hindrance to victory; practicality is more useful. You may attack as a Simple Action with any non-Samurai melee weapon, and gain +1k0 to damage with any Peasant Weapon.'}]},
    {'name': 'Tortoise Killers', 'clan': 'Minor Clan', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'SE'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Kasuga Smuggler 3', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Poisoned Frog', 'effect': 'Once per opponent per skirmish, when making an attack roll spend a Void Point to cause your Raises for damage on that roll to award +1k1 rather than +1k0. You may never take more Raises than your Void Rank when using this Technique.'}]},
    {'name': 'Ujina Skirmishers: Hare Clan', 'clan': 'Minor Clan', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Usagi Bushi 2', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Master of the Quick Blade', 'effect': 'The Ujina are trained to fight with a tanto in each hand, cutting their foes to death with swift and deadly strikes. When fighting with a knife in each hand, gain +1k0 to Initiative rolls and +1k1 to damage rolls with knives.'}]},
    {'name': 'Kenku Swordsman School', 'clan': 'Miscellaneous', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '+1 Reflexes', 'skills': 'Defense, Hunting, Kenjutsu (Katana), Meditation, Tea Ceremony, any one Lore Skill, any one Bugei Skill', 'honor': 'N/A (Kenku do not use the standard Honor system)', 'outfit': 'Light or Heavy Armor, Daisho, Traveling Pack, 3 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Wing of Thunder', 'effect': 'Add the total of your Reflexes and School Rank to your Armor TN against any enemy with lower Initiative.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Heaven’s Claw', 'effect': 'Any time you inflict more than 10 points of damage with a single attack, your opponent loses one Void Point. Against opponents with no Void Points remaining (or no Void), re-roll a single damage die and take the better result.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Lightning Kiss', 'effect': 'You may attack as a Simple Action while using any melee weapon in which you possess a Skill Emphasis.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Churning Skies', 'effect': 'If you delay your Turn until after all opponents have acted, ignore all Wound Penalties (including Down and Out) and spend any amount of Void Points on damage rolls this Round.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'The Same Breeze', 'effect': 'At the beginning of your Turn, spend a Void Point as a Free Action to copy one bushi Technique of any character within 20’ for a number of Rounds equal to your Air Ring. You must abide by all costs and restrictions of the copied Technique. If not a Kenku yourself, you must have seen the Technique used at least once. You may only copy one Technique at a time.'}]},
    {'name': 'Kshatriya Warrior: Ivory Kingdoms', 'clan': 'Miscellaneous', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '+1 Agility', 'skills': 'Archery, Defense, Hand-to-Hand, Horsemanship, Lore: Theology (Ivory Kingdoms), Spears, Swordsmanship, any one appropriate High Skill', 'honor': '5.0 (Integrity)', 'outfit': 'Sword, shield, spear, bow, light armor, steed, elegant clothing, 10 koku (equivalent)', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Strength of Indra', 'effect': 'Gain +1k0 with all School Weapon Skills. When rolling to resist a Fear effect, your Willpower is considered one Rank higher.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'The Ward of Vishnu', 'effect': 'While carrying a shield, take a Simple Action to make a Contested Defense / Agility roll against one opponent’s Weapon Skill / Agility. If successful, that opponent must call three extra Raises to strike you until the start of your next Turn.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'The Speed of the Mongoose', 'effect': 'Make melee attacks as a Simple Action when fighting with a sword, spear, or unarmed.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'The Virtue of the Gods', 'effect': 'Once per skirmish after a successful attack, spend a Void Point to add unkept dice equal to your Lore: Theology (Ivory Kingdoms) rank to your damage roll.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'The Courage of Shiva', 'effect': 'Gain +1k1 to resist Fear effects. If reduced to Out or Dead, on your next Turn you may take one final Simple Action which suffers no Wound penalties.'}]},
    {'name': 'Sainika Fighter: Ivory Kingdoms', 'clan': 'Miscellaneous', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Guru'], 'benefit': '+1 Void', 'skills': 'Athletics, Defense, Hand-to-Hand, Knives, Lore: Theology (Ivory Kingdoms), Medicine, Meditation, any one High Skill', 'honor': '6.0 (Integrity)', 'outfit': 'Simple clothing, knife, sandals', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Harmony', 'effect': 'Add your Void Rank to your Armor TN. Add your Void Rank in unkept dice to any Contested Roll to resist Social Skill Rolls, Social Techniques, and Fear effects.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Vision', 'effect': 'Spend a Void Point and take a Simple Action to assess your opponent. For the remainder of the skirmish, gain +Xk0 to attack rolls against that opponent, where X is the opponent’s lowest Trait.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Understanding', 'effect': 'Roll additional dice on all Perception-based rolls equal to your Void Rank.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Unity', 'effect': 'Make attacks as a Simple Action when fighting unarmed or with a knife.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'Purity', 'effect': 'When attacking with an unarmed blow or knife, spend a Void Point to also strike the opponent’s spiritual being. If your attack hits, make a Contested Void roll vs the opponent. On success, the opponent suffers -Xk0 (where X is your Void Rank) on Skill Rolls until the third Reactions Stage from now. Your attack still deals normal physical damage. Spiritual effects cannot be stacked, though duration can be extended.'}]},
    {'name': 'Dragon Channeler', 'clan': 'Miscellaneous', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': ['BoV'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: N/A (must be a Rank 5 shugenja)', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Beseech the Dragons', 'effect': 'Lose any Affinities and Deficiencies, gaining instead an Affinity for Dragon Spells. Normal spell slots are reduced by 2 in each Ring; in return, gain three Dragon Spell Slots usable only to invoke the powers of the Dragons. Spend Void Points to cast additional Dragon spells when slots are exhausted. Dragon spell slots do not recover from rest: regain one slot only through two hours of uninterrupted meditation at Meditation / Void TN 30.'}]},
    {'name': 'Kolat Master', 'clan': 'Miscellaneous', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': ['EoE'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Technique (or none) at Insight Rank 6 or higher', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Will of the Master', 'effect': 'You are Status 10 to any character who is a Kolat member of your Sect, and Status 9 to any Kolat of another Sect. Gain +2k0 on all Courtier and Intimidation Skill rolls.'}]},
    {'name': 'Agents of the Second Gozoku', 'clan': 'Miscellaneous', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': [], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any School 2', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'To Shield the Empress', 'effect': 'The Second Gozoku believes they do what they must to protect the Empress from the harsh realities of rule. Whenever you take an action that would result in Honor point loss, if by taking this action you spare Honor or Glory point loss to someone of higher Status Rank than you, the loss is halved (rounded down).'}]},
