    {'name': 'The Unbroken', 'clan': 'Ronin', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Unbroken', 'effect': 'When fighting a Shadowlands creature or one of the Lost, add Taint Rank in unkept dice to attack rolls (gain 3 Taint Points each time this is used). Any time you singlehandedly kill a Shadowlands creature or Lost, spend a Void Point to permanently lose one Taint Point. If you singlehandedly kill an extremely powerful Shadowlands foe (major oni, Onisu, or Lost of at least two Insight Ranks higher), spend a Void Point and make a Contested Earth roll against the foe’s Earth: on success, purge all Taint from your body (and permanently lose the ability to use this Technique).'}]},
    {'name': 'Tsume Pikemen', 'clan': 'Ronin', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'IH'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Wall of Pikes', 'effect': 'While in Defense Stance with a spear or polearm, when an opponent makes a melee attack against you or an ally within 10’, spend a Void Point as a Free Action to immediately attack that opponent. In Full Defense, costs 2 Void Points instead.'}]},
    {'name': 'Weavers', 'clan': 'Ronin', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'EnE'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Twist the Weave', 'effect': 'If you have ever won a Contested Skill Roll against someone using Sincerity (Deceit), Intimidation, or Temptation, when you subsequently face that person in a skirmish gain a Free Raise usable on an attack roll during the first Round.'}]},
    {'name': 'Wolf Legion', 'clan': 'Ronin', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'EnE'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Black Lion Talon', 'effect': 'Whenever you spend a Void Point to add +1k1 to an attack roll, also add your Honor Rank to the total of that attack roll.'}]},
    {'name': 'Bayushi Bushi', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Intelligence', 'skills': 'Courtier (Manipulation), Defense, Etiquette, Iaijutsu, Kenjutsu, Sincerity, any one Skill', 'honor': '2.5', 'outfit': 'Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, 5 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Way of the Scorpion', 'effect': '+1k1 to Initiative Rolls. +5 to Armor TN against any opponent with lower Initiative.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Pincers and Tail', 'effect': 'The Feint Maneuver costs only 1 Raise instead of 2.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Strike at the Tail', 'effect': 'When assuming a Stance, choose a target within 30’. If you hit them this Turn, the target is Fatigued as if without rest for 24 hours. Each Reactions Stage, the affected opponent may roll Earth Ring (TN 25) to negate; if they fail, the effect persists until the next Reactions Stage.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Strike From Above, Strike From Below', 'effect': 'Make melee attacks as a Simple Action instead of a Complex Action.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'The Pincers Hold, The Tail Strikes', 'effect': 'Once per encounter, spend a Void Point as a Complex Action to attack with a melee weapon. On a hit, the target is Stunned. Each Reactions Stage, the affected opponent may roll Earth Ring (TN = damage dealt) to end the Stun; if they fail or do not attempt it, the Stun ends the following Reactions Stage.'}]},
    {'name': 'Bayushi Courtier', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Awareness', 'skills': 'Calligraphy, Courtier (Gossip), Etiquette, Investigation, Sincerity (Deceit), Temptation, any one High Skill', 'honor': '2.5', 'outfit': 'Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 5 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Weakness is My Strength', 'effect': 'When making a Contested Social Roll, gain one Free Raise per 3 points of Mental or Social Disadvantages your opponent possesses (max 5 Free Raises). Also gain a Free Raise when using Courtier to spread gossip, and need not Raise to conceal that you are the source.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Shallow Waters', 'effect': 'After conversing with someone for a few minutes, make a Contested Investigation/Awareness vs Etiquette/Awareness roll. On success, learn the identity and rank of their lowest Mental Trait and lowest Social Skill (at least 1 Rank). Spend a Void Point to also learn their next-lowest Mental Trait and Social Skill.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Secrets are Birthmarks', 'effect': 'Contested Courtier (Manipulation)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness to lure a target into revealing one Mental or Social Disadvantage (or Advantage if they have none). With GM permission, a revealed Disadvantage may allow you to take a 2-point Blackmail Advantage against that individual at no XP cost.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Scrutiny’s Sweet Sting', 'effect': 'In Contested Social Skill Rolls against someone you hold Blackmail on, their dice cannot explode. In any Contested Social Skill Roll, spend a Void Point to force the opponent to use a Mental Trait of your choice instead of the normal Trait.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'No More Masks', 'effect': 'School Rank times per session, make a Contested Courtier (Gossip)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness roll (+5k0 bonus if you hold Blackmail on the target). On success, inflict one of the following Social Disadvantages for one month: Social Disadvantage, Sworn Enemy, or Obligation (to someone of your choice). Cannot target the same person until the effect expires.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shosuro Actor', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Ninja'], 'benefit': '+1 Awareness', 'skills': 'Acting, Etiquette, Knives, Meditation, Sincerity (Deceit), Stealth, any 1 High or Low Skill', 'honor': '1.5', 'outfit': 'Fine Clothing, Assorted Costumes and Disguises, Knife, Traveling Pack, 10 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The First Face', 'effect': 'Learn one persona. When spending a Void Point on Acting or Sincerity (Deceit), gain +3k1 instead of the normal +1k1.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'The Subtle Sting', 'effect': '+2k0 to attack rolls when wielding a Small weapon.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'The Second Face', 'effect': 'Learn a second persona. May now spend 2 Void Points (instead of 1) when enhancing a School Skill roll. Stacks with Rank 1.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'The Viper’s Kiss', 'effect': 'Attack as a Simple Action instead of a Complex Action when using a Small-sized weapon.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'The Third Face', 'effect': 'Learn a third persona. When attacking a foe who is unaware or does not expect danger from you, Raises are not limited by your Void.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shosuro Infiltrator', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Ninja', 'CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Reflexes', 'skills': 'Acting, Athletics, Ninjutsu, Sincerity, Stealth (Sneaking) 2, any one Skill', 'honor': '1.5', 'outfit': 'Ashigaru or Light Armor, Sturdy Black Clothing, Daisho, Bow or Knife, Traveling Pack, 5 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Path of Shadows', 'effect': 'No Honor point loss for use of Low Skills or Ninjutsu Weapons in service of the Scorpion Clan (GM approval). +2k0 to all Stealth Skill rolls.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Strike From Darkness', 'effect': 'When declaring an attack against an opponent unaware of your presence, Raises are not limited by Void and you roll additional dice equal to your School Rank on the attack roll. Against an opponent suffering a Condition effect, roll half that number of additional unkept dice instead. The two effects are not cumulative: choose one.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Steel Within Silk', 'effect': 'When attacking from ambush as above, or using Ninjutsu weapons, make melee (or shuriken ranged) attacks as a Simple Action. Alternatively, take a Complex Action to make a number of shuriken ranged attacks equal to your School Rank.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Whisper of Steel', 'effect': 'Even after attacking, opponents must win a Contested Investigation (Notice)/Perception vs Stealth/Agility roll to detect you. Only usable when making a single attack per round. GM may rule this does not work where concealment is impossible.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'The Final Silence', 'effect': 'After a successful damage roll, spend a Void Point to increase any two dice to show 10s (these do not explode). May spend multiple Void Points this way, each increasing up to two damage dice.'}]},
    {'name': 'Soshi Magistrate', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'EE'], 'benefit': '+1 Agility', 'skills': 'Athletics, Defense, Intimidation (Control), Jiujutsu, Kenjutsu, Lore: Underworld, any Bugei Skill', 'honor': '2.5', 'outfit': 'Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, 5 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Face of Justice', 'effect': '+1k0 to Intimidation; +2k0 instead when used against someone of lower Status Rank. +1k0 damage bonus with melee attacks.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Rise to Meet the Challenge', 'effect': 'When Prone, Free Action to roll Athletics/Agility (TN 20) to regain your feet. +1k1 bonus to any roll made to control a Grapple.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'The Magistrate’s Cut', 'effect': 'Once per opponent per skirmish, by successfully making three Raises for a Called Shot on a melee attack, temporarily Blind a foe until the Reactions stage of the following Round.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Certainty of Purpose', 'effect': 'Make melee attacks (including unarmed) as Simple Actions rather than Complex Actions.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'Relentless Resolve', 'effect': 'Once per skirmish, gain extra unkept dice equal to your Intimidation Skill Rank on all attack rolls for one Round. Cannot be used in Center Stance.'}]},
    {'name': 'Soshi Shugenja', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Awareness', 'skills': 'Calligraphy (Cipher), Courtier, Etiquette, Lore: Theology, Spellcraft, Stealth, any one Skill', 'honor': '2.5', 'outfit': 'Robes, Wakizashi, Knife, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 5 koku', 'affinity': 'Air / Earth | Starting Spells: Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Air, 2 Fire, 1 Water', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Kami’s Whisper', 'effect': 'When casting any spell with no potential to inflict damage, sacrifice an additional spell slot of the same Element to eliminate all visible signs of the spell having been cast. All spell effects take place normally: there is simply no outward sign of what has happened. Free Raise on any spell with the Illusion keyword.'}]},
    {'name': 'Yogo Wardmaster', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Shugenja'], 'benefit': '+1 Intelligence', 'skills': 'Calligraphy (Cipher), Etiquette, Investigation, Lore: Theology, Spellcraft, Stealth, any 1 High or Low Skill', 'honor': '1.5', 'outfit': 'Robes, Wakizashi, Knife, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, pack of twenty paper wards, 3 koku', 'affinity': 'Affinity for all non-Void spells with the Wards keyword; Deficiency for all spells with the Travel or Craft keywords. No standard elemental Affinity or Deficiency.', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Way of the Wardmaster', 'effect': 'When casting any spell with the Wards keyword, Raise a number of times equal to the spell’s Mastery Level to instead place the spell into a paper ward. The ward holds the spell latent until you activate it (Simple Action) by placing it on a target, discharging the spell immediately. Only you may activate your wards. Placing a ward on an unwilling target requires an unarmed melee attack (Spellcraft/Agility). An active ward may be physically destroyed (Simple Action) ending all ongoing effects; if destroyed before discharge, the spell slot is recovered normally. You cannot recover a slot cast into a ward until after the ward discharges. The following spells are treated as having the Wards keyword: Air: To Seek the Truth, By the Light of the Moon, Benten’s Touch, Summon Fog; Earth: Armor of the Earth, Courage of the 7 Thunders, Force of Will, Wholeness of the World; Fire: Extinguish, Fires of Purity, Disrupt the Aura, Haze of Battle, Globe of Everlasting Sun; Water: Reversal of Fortunes, Rejuvenating Vapors, Wisdom and Clarity, Near to Ice.'}]},
    {'name': 'Scorpion Instigator', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': ['Courtier', 'CR'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Depths of Dishonor', 'effect': 'When making a Contested Social Skill Roll, gain +Xk0, where X is the difference between your Honor Rank and your opponent’s.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Sheath Your Lies in Truth', 'effect': 'If anyone is trying to determine whether you are lying, spend a Void Point to gain +3k3 on the Contested Social Skill Roll to conceal your falsehood (instead of normal +1k1).'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Pull the String', 'effect': 'If you possess Blackmail on someone, spend 10 minutes conversing with them and spend a Void Point as a Complex Action to suggest an action. Win a Contested Courtier (Manipulation)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Willpower roll: on success, the target must take the action or lose 4 Honor points (provided the action is not life-threatening and its consequences are not worse than revealing the Blackmail).'}]},
    {'name': 'Scorpion Saboteur', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': ['Ninja', 'IH'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Follow the Pincers', 'effect': '+1k1 to all Stealth rolls. No Initiative penalties for being surprised, Dazed, or Fatigued.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'No Mistakes', 'effect': 'When spending a Void Point on a Craft: Explosives roll, gain +2k2 instead of +1k1. Suffer no ill effects from low rolls with Craft: Explosives and are immune to the optional “fizzle” rule.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Seeking Weakness', 'effect': 'When fighting with a Small weapon (melee or ranged), make one attack as a Free Action each Round in addition to any other actions. Also ignore the effects of your opponent’s armor on both Armor TN and Reduction when fighting with a Small weapon.'}]},
    {'name': 'Bayushi Distracter', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Courtier'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Courtier 3. Requires: Sincerity (Deceit) 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Smoke Screen', 'effect': 'Roll Sincerity (Deceit)/Awareness vs target’s Investigation/Awareness (targets with a directly relevant Lore Skill may substitute Lore/Intelligence). On success, the target must call one Raise for no effect any time they make a Social Roll involving the misinformed topic. Call additional Raises to increase the number of wasted Raises required. Effects last one week; cannot target the same person within the same week.'}]},
    {'name': 'Bitter Lies Swordsman', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'CR'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Bushi 3. Requires: Kenjutsu 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Dark Sword of Bitter Lies', 'effect': 'Spend a Void Point to immediately reroll any one roll. The reroll suffers no penalty to the TN even if the original roll failed. You may keep whichever result you prefer. You may not reroll the same roll again by any means.'}]},
    {'name': 'Fading Shadows', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Scorpion Shugenja 5. Requires: Void 4, Spellcraft 5, Forbidden Knowledge: Lying Darkness. Must be inducted into the Hidden Moon Dojo.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Unravel the Shadow', 'effect': 'Simple Action: spend a Void Point to attempt a Contested Void vs Willpower roll against any Shadowspawn or minions of the Nothing within sight. On success, creatures are revealed as what they truly are and cannot reassume a false identity while in your sight. Free Action: spend a Void Point when casting a spell or making a physical attack for it to have full effect on a minion of the Nothing regardless of normal resistances or immunities.'}]},
    {'name': 'Kuroiban', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Scorpion Shugenja 4. Requires: Willpower 4, Lore: Maho 3, Lore: Shadowlands 3. Must have been chosen to serve in the Kuroiban.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Black Watch', 'effect': 'Any time you target someone with a spell (including benign spells), expend an additional spell slot (any Element) as a Free Action and make a Contested Willpower roll. On success, you sense whether the target has at least one full Rank of Taint. If trained in the Yogo Shugenja School, this technique may also be triggered when placing a ward, activating at the moment the ward is placed.'}]},
    {'name': 'Saigo’s Blades', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Bushi 3. Requires: Iaijutsu 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Saigo’s Technique', 'effect': 'When dueling any opponent you have previously used the Intimidation Skill upon successfully, gain +5 to your roll during the Assessment Phase. By spending a Void Point, report one statistic of your choice as being one Rank higher during the Assessment Phase.'}]},
    {'name': 'Scorpion Loyalist', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['IH'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Scorpion School at Rank 2. Requires: Courtier 4 (courtiers), Spellcraft 4 (shugenja), or one Weapon Skill at 4 (bushi/ninja).', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'No Matter the Cost', 'effect': 'Sacrifice up to School Rank points of Honor to gain a bonus on one roll made against non-Scorpion opponents. Bushi/ninja gain +1k0 per Honor point on attack rolls; courtiers gain the same on Contested Social Skill Rolls; shugenja gain the same on spell-casting rolls for Air spells targeting those opponents.'}]},
    {'name': 'Scorpion Maskmaker', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Courtier/Artisan'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Courtier 2, Soshi Shugenja 2, Yogo Wardmaster 2. Requires: Craft: Maskmaking 5, Sincerity (Deceit).', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Conceal the Eyes', 'effect': 'Once every three months, craft a mask with two Raises on a Craft: Maskmaking roll: the mask matches the abilities of the Inheritance Advantage with the Sincerity Skill. +2k0 on any Social Skill roll to detect falsehood or concealed intentions in others.'}]},
    {'name': 'Scorpion Weaponmaster', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Bushi 4. Requires: Any three Weapon Skills at 2.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'I Am A Weapon', 'effect': 'School Rank times per skirmish, as a Free Action use any other melee Weapon Skill you possess for attack rolls with your current weapon. No Mastery Abilities or Emphases apply when using this Technique. Effect lasts School Rank Rounds; while active, make melee attacks as a Simple Action.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shadow Blades', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Ninja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Bushi 3 or Shosuro Infiltrator 3. Requires: Ninjutsu 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Never Beyond My Reach', 'effect': 'Make melee attacks as a Simple Action when wielding a katana or any weapon with the Ninja keyword. When wielding a Ninja keyword weapon, +1k1 to attack and damage rolls with that weapon.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shadow Hunter', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja', 'CR'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Scorpion Shugenja School 3. Requires: Stealth 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Scourge in Shadow', 'effect': 'When casting a damaging spell targeting an opponent unaware of your presence, gain +2k0 on the Spell Casting Roll. Spend a single spell slot as a Free Action to gain +1k1 on a Knives or Stealth Skill Roll.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shosuro Assassins', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Ninja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: N/A (Rank 6). Requires: Stealth 5, Knives 5, must have attained Rank 5 in either Shosuro Infiltrator or Shosuro Actor.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Hidden Blade', 'effect': 'When attacking a surprised or unaware opponent with a knife, spend a Void Point as a Free Action. Your attack targets a vital spot: Raises for damage on that attack are kept dice (+1k1 per Raise) instead of unkept (+1k0).'}]},
    {'name': 'Shosuro Defilers', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Courtier'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Courtier 3 or Shosuro Actor 3. Requires: Sincerity (Deceit) 3, Glory Rank 3.0+.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Shameless Slander', 'effect': 'Slander someone in court (directly or indirectly) and roll Sincerity (Deceit)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Willpower (+1k1 bonus if the slander is based on a real secret or disgrace). On success, the target loses Honor points and gains Infamy points equal to your current Glory Rank. If they do not promptly and effectively answer your slander within the first week, they also lose 1 Rank of Devotion from all Allies. If you lose the Contested Roll, you lose 3 Glory points. Cannot target the same person more than once per month.'}]},
    {'name': 'Sons of Shadow', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi/Shugenja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Soshi Magistrate 3, Soshi Shugenja 3. Requires: Lore: Shugenja 3 or Lore: Law 3 (whichever applies to the opposite school).', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'None Shall Know My Path', 'effect': 'Soshi Shugenja: Simple Action, spend a spell slot to gain temporary Skill Ranks equal to School Rank in Athletics, Defense, Intimidation, or Lore: Underworld. Soshi Magistrate: Simple Action, spend a Void Point to gain temporary Skill Ranks equal to School Rank in Calligraphy, Courtier, Etiquette, Lore: Theology, Spellcraft, or Stealth. Temporary Ranks last one hour. No Mastery Abilities are gained.'}]},
    {'name': 'Soshi Deceivers', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Soshi Shugenja 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Way of the Shadow', 'effect': 'Sacrifice a spell slot of any Element to gain perfect vision in absolute darkness. Alternatively, spend an Air or Void spell slot to gain +1k1 to Stealth, Sleight of Hand, or Sincerity (Deceit) Skill Rolls. May not spend more spell slots than your Insight Rank on any one Skill Roll.'}]},
    {'name': 'The Scorpion Elite Guard', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Bushi 3, Shosuro Actor 3. Requires: Lore (selected clan) 3, Kenjutsu 5. Heart of Vengeance [Selected Clan] may substitute for the Lore requirement at GM’s option.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Eyes of My Enemy', 'effect': 'Select one Great Clan when learning this Technique (cannot be changed). Attack as a Simple Action when targeting a samurai from this clan. Once per skirmish against a samurai from this clan, spend a Void Point as a Simple Action to prevent that samurai from using his School Techniques for his next two Turns. Cannot be used in iaijutsu duels.'}]},
    {'name': 'The Scorpion’s Tail', 'clan': 'Scorpion', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi/Ninja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Bayushi Bushi 3, Shosuro Infiltrator 4. Requires: Athletics 4, Chain Weapons 4.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Tail’s Reach', 'effect': '+1k1 to Athletics rolls when using any chain weapon as a climbing tool. Attack with a kusarigama at up to 15’ distance. When attacking with a kusarigama, call three Raises to inflict the Lame Disadvantage on the opponent: lasting until the Wounds from the attack are healed.'}]},
    {'name': 'Horiuchi Shugenja', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': [], 'benefit': '+1 Stamina', 'skills': 'Calligraphy, Craft: Meishodo, Defense, Lore: Theology, Meditation, Spellcraft (Spell Research), any 1 High or Bugei Skill', 'honor': '4.5', 'outfit': 'Robes, Wakizashi, Knife, Scroll/Amulet Satchel, Traveling Pack, 4 koku', 'affinity': 'Earth / Air | Starting Spells: Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Earth, 2 Water, 1 Fire', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Mysteries of Meishodo', 'effect': 'Create a meishodo amulet by rolling Craft: Meishodo/Ring (TN 15 + 5 × spell Mastery Level), taking hours equal to the Mastery Level. On success, the amulet casts the chosen spell as one Complex Action regardless of Mastery Level: no Spell Casting Roll required but no Raises apply (not even Free Raises). Expend a spell slot as normal. May only create meishodo from spells of Mastery Level equal to or less than your Shugenja School Rank; can never create meishodo of Mastery Level 4, 5, or 6. Other meishodo-trained shugenja may use your amulets.'}]},
    {'name': 'Ide Emissary', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Courtier', 'CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Awareness', 'skills': 'Calligraphy, Commerce, Courtier, Etiquette (Conversation), Horsemanship, Sincerity (Honesty), any one High or Perform Skill', 'honor': '5.5', 'outfit': 'Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, 10 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Heart Speaks', 'effect': 'In any situation where you might inadvertently give offense (through accident or ignorance), roll Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness (TN 20) to avoid doing so. Free Raise on Sincerity (Honesty) rolls. Any time you roll Sincerity (Deceit), TN is increased by +5.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Piercing the Veils', 'effect': 'Make a Contested Etiquette/Awareness vs target’s Etiquette/Willpower roll to read someone’s true emotions in a social situation. On success, gain a general sense of their true feelings. Raise for more specific information (GM’s adjudication).'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'The Heart Listens', 'effect': 'Spend at least 10 minutes in conversation, then make a Contested Sincerity (Honesty)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Willpower roll to shift the target’s attitude in a positive direction. Two successful Raises make the target regard you as an Ally for the remainder of the day (GM approval). Cannot be used on Sworn Enemies.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Answering the Heart', 'effect': 'When using your Rank 2 and Rank 3 Techniques, roll additional unkept dice equal to your School Rank.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'The Immovable Hand of Peace', 'effect': 'Spend a Void Point and make a Contested Sincerity (Honesty)/Awareness vs Etiquette (Courtesy)/Awareness roll. On success, the target cannot take any hostile action against you (physical, social, or magical) for hours equal to twice your School Rank, as long as you likewise refrain from hostility. Does not work against those with Honor Rank below 2.0 or no Honor Rank.'}]},
    {'name': 'Iuchi Shugenja', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Perception', 'skills': 'Battle, Calligraphy (Cipher), Horsemanship, Lore: Theology, Meditation, Spellcraft, any one High or Bugei Skill', 'honor': '5.5', 'outfit': 'Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, Scroll Satchel, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, Horse (Unicorn Riding Horse), 10 koku', 'affinity': 'Water / Fire | Starting Spells: Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Water, 2 Earth, 1 Air', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Spirit of the Wind', 'effect': 'Complex Action: sacrifice one spell slot of any element to grant one target individual an additional Simple Move Action on their next Turn (lost if not used). Free Raise on any spell with the Travel keyword.'}]},
    {'name': 'Moto Bushi', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Strength', 'skills': 'Athletics, Defense, Horsemanship, Hunting, Kenjutsu (Scimitar), any one Bugei Skill, any one Skill', 'honor': '3.5', 'outfit': 'Riding or Heavy Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, Heavy Weapon or Polearm, Traveling Pack, Horse (Unicorn Riding Horse), any one weapon, 10 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Way of the Unicorn', 'effect': 'Wield any two-handed weapon with one hand (except bows). +1k0 to damage rolls while mounted, using a scimitar, or using a two-handed melee weapon (bonuses do not stack). Scimitars have the Samurai keyword for you.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Shinsei’s Smile', 'effect': 'Gain a bonus to attack rolls equal to half your opponent’s Wound Rank TN penalties (rounded down). Example: opponent in Crippled Wound Rank grants +10 to attack roll totals.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Desert Wind Strike', 'effect': 'Make attacks as a Simple Action instead of a Complex Action when using a melee weapon.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'The Charge of Madness', 'effect': 'Once per skirmish, if you bring a target down to the Out Wound Level, immediately make one additional attack as a Free Action against a different target. No Raises allowed on this attack.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'Moto Cannot Yield', 'effect': 'While mounted or in Full Attack Stance, keep additional damage dice equal to half your Strength (rounded down). Only applies when wielding a two-handed weapon or a weapon with the Samurai keyword.'}]},
    {'name': 'Moto Death Priest', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Shugenja', 'IH'], 'benefit': '+1 Willpower', 'skills': 'Athletics, Horsemanship, Hunting, Lore: Theology, Meditation, Spellcraft, any 1 Skill', 'honor': '3.5', 'outfit': 'Sturdy Traveling Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, Horse (Unicorn Steed), 5 koku', 'affinity': 'Earth / Air | Starting Spells: Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Earth, 2 Fire, 1 Water', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Blessings of the Shi-Tien Yen-Wang', 'effect': 'Simple Action: sacrifice a spell slot and target one enemy within School Rank × 100 feet. Make a Contested Willpower Roll. On success, the target may not benefit from exploding dice or Advantages that allow rerolling for Rounds equal to your School Rank. Free Raise on any spell with the Travel keyword.'}]},
    {'name': 'Moto Vindicator', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '+1 Willpower', 'skills': 'Horsemanship, Hunting, Investigation (Notice), Kenjutsu, Kyujutsu, Lore: Shadowlands, any 1 Bugei Skill', 'honor': '3.5', 'outfit': 'Heavy Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 Weapon, Traveling Pack, Riding Horse, 5 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Purity of the Breath', 'effect': 'At the start of each Round, choose one effect until end of Round: reduce TN penalties from Wound Ranks by School Rank + Willpower, or add School Rank + Willpower to Armor TN. Both bonuses are doubled when in a skirmish against Shadowlands creatures.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Facing the Dark Within', 'effect': '+2k0 to all Investigation rolls; increased to +2k1 when specifically attempting to notice the effects of Shadowlands Taint.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Justice of Our Ancestors', 'effect': 'Make melee attacks as a Simple Action instead of a Complex Action.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Avenging Our Own', 'effect': '+2k0 to attack and damage rolls against any enemy who has attacked you in a skirmish, and against any creature with the Shadowlands Taint.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'Bloodied but Unbowed', 'effect': 'Once per skirmish, Free Action to activate. While making melee attacks, gain a bonus to damage roll totals equal to the TN penalties you are suffering from Wound Ranks (using default penalties, ignoring modifications). Lasts two full Rounds. May extend by one additional Round by taking 10 Wounds.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shinjo Bushi', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['EE'], 'benefit': '+1 Agility', 'skills': 'Athletics, Defense, Horsemanship 2, Kenjutsu, Kyujutsu, any 1 Skill', 'honor': '4.5', 'outfit': 'Ashigaru or Light Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, Bow, Knife, Traveling Pack, Horse, 10 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'The Way of the Ki-Rin', 'effect': 'When spending a Void Point to add +1k1 to any School Skill Roll, also add your Horsemanship Skill Rank to the total. Cannot be used in Center Stance.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Dance of the Blade', 'effect': 'While in Full Defense Stance, when an opponent succeeds with an attack targeting you, take a Free Action to make a Contested Agility Roll against that opponent. On success, the attack misses. May be done School Rank times per Round.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'The Four Winds Strike', 'effect': 'Attack as a Simple Action with weapons with the Samurai keyword. While mounted, also attack as a Simple Action with a bow.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Spirit of the Blade Unleashed', 'effect': 'While in Defense or Full Defense Stance, when an opponent makes a melee attack targeting you, after the attack resolves take a Free Action to make one melee attack against that opponent (immediately assumes Attack Stance). Usable School Rank times per skirmish, once per Round.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'Dancing With the Fortunes', 'effect': 'While mounted, when you wish to spend a Void Point, roll Void Ring (TN 20) as a Free Action. On success, gain the mechanical benefit of spending the Void Point without actually spending it. On failure, spend it as normal. Usable times per skirmish equal to Void Points at skirmish start. On foot, TN increases to 30.'}]},
    {'name': 'Utaku Battle Maiden', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'CR'], 'benefit': '+1 Reflexes', 'skills': 'Battle, Defense, Horsemanship 2, Kenjutsu, Sincerity, any one High or Bugei Skill', 'honor': '6.5', 'outfit': 'Light or Riding Armor, Sturdy Clothing, Daisho, any 1 weapon, Traveling Pack, Horse (Utaku Warhorse), 10 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Riding in Harmony', 'effect': 'Gain a bonus equal to your Honor Rank to one attack per Round. While mounted, may instead apply this bonus to one damage roll. Also add Honor Rank to all Horsemanship roll totals.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'The Void of War', 'effect': 'During Stage 1 of any Combat Round, add 5 to either your Initiative Score or your Armor TN. Lasts until you use this Technique again or the skirmish ends.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Sensing the Breeze', 'effect': 'While mounted, make attacks as a Simple Action instead of a Complex Action.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Wind Never Stops', 'effect': 'While mounted, spend a Void Point and take a Simple Action to charge and attack at the end of your movement (movement and attack use the same Simple Action, using the steed’s movement rate). On a successful hit, +2k1 to all damage rolls this Turn.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'Otaku’s Blessing', 'effect': 'At the start of your Turn, spend a Void Point as a Free Action. Add Honor Rank to all damage rolls and Bugei Skill Rolls this Turn. Stacks with Riding in Harmony.'}]},
    {'name': 'Utaku Mounted Infantry', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'basic', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '+1 Agility', 'skills': 'Athletics, Battle, Defense, Kenjutsu, Polearms, Spears, any one Bugei or High Skill', 'honor': '5.5', 'outfit': 'Normal Clothing, Daisho, any one spear or polearm, Light Armor, Steed (Unicorn Riding Horse), Traveling Pack, 5 koku', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Choose Your Weapon', 'effect': 'Select Kenjutsu, Polearms, or Spears: gain a free Emphasis of your choice in that Skill. +1k0 to attack rolls with the chosen Skill. If Spears or Polearms: in Defense or Full Defense Stance while wielding that weapon, add Skill Ranks to Armor TN. If Kenjutsu: add half Skill Rank (rounded down) instead.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Speed of My Sisters', 'effect': 'On foot, move as though Water Ring is 1 Rank higher. +1k0 to Initiative rolls.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'All-Fronts Attack', 'effect': 'With your chosen weapon Skill, attack as a Simple Action instead of a Complex Action.'}, {'rank': 4, 'name': 'Utaku’s Thunder', 'effect': 'Once per skirmish while wielding your chosen weapon, spend a Void Point to add Honor Rank in unkept dice to your attack roll. Movement bonus from Rank 2 now treats Water Ring as 2 higher instead of 1.'}, {'rank': 5, 'name': 'Epic of My Name', 'effect': 'Rank 1 Armor TN bonus now also applies in Attack Stance. Once per skirmish in Full Attack Stance, add +4k2 to a damage roll with your chosen weapon (Spears or Polearms may also use this in Attack Stance).'}]},
    {'name': 'The White Guard', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'advanced', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'CR'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': '', 'techniques': [{'rank': 1, 'name': 'Pale Face of Death', 'effect': 'Spend a Void Point as a Free Action at the start of your Turn to choose one opponent within 30’. They suffer TN penalties to all actions equal to your Lore: Theology Skill Rank for the rest of the encounter. Only one target may be affected at a time.'}, {'rank': 2, 'name': 'Moto’s Strength', 'effect': 'Ignore TN penalties from Wound Levels equal to double your Lore: Theology Skill Rank.'}, {'rank': 3, 'name': 'Fury of Heaven', 'effect': 'When you make an attack, spend a Void Point to add five times your Lore: Theology Skill Rank to the total of your roll.'}]},
    {'name': 'Calm Heart Duelist', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Unicorn Bushi School 3. Requires: Iaijutsu 3, Lore: Law 1.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Calm Heart Conquers', 'effect': '+1k0 to any Iaijutsu Skill Roll when not striking to kill (duel to first blood or skirmish). Make melee attacks as a Simple Action when wielding a katana or wakizashi.'}]},
    {'name': 'Hand of Peace', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Courtier'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Ide Emissary 4. Requires: Honor 5.0+.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Ide’s Ideal', 'effect': 'When able to propose a peaceful solution to a diplomatic problem, roll Courtier (Rhetoric)/Awareness vs opponent’s Etiquette (Courtesy)/Willpower. On success, the opponent is forced to make a meaningful concession (GM chooses the specifics). Usable twice per encounter. If you commit an act of violence that inflicts damage on a fellow Rokugani, lose this Technique’s benefits for one month.'}]},
    {'name': 'Ide Caravan Master', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Courtier'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Ide Emissary 1 (uses same Benefit, Skills, Honor, and Outfit). Requires: Commerce 2.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Gilded Road', 'effect': '+1k1 on all Commerce Skill Rolls, and on all Social Skill Rolls made with your customers. Gain one level of the Wealthy Advantage and one instance of the Way of the Land Advantage for free.'}]},
    {'name': 'Ide Trader', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Courtier'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Ide Emissary 2. Requires: Commerce 3, must pursue a career as a merchant patron.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Brisk Economy', 'effect': 'Cannot lose Honor points or Glory points for using the Commerce Skill in public. Persuade someone to become a mercantile partner by rolling Courtier (Manipulation)/Awareness with a bonus equal to double your Commerce Skill Rank (TN 25 for commoners, Contested vs Etiquette/Willpower for samurai). On success, the target becomes a free Ally with 1 point of Devotion.'}]},
    {'name': 'Iuchi Couriers (Lord of the Plains)', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Iuchi Shugenja 2. Requires: Horsemanship 3, Way of the Land Advantage.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Beyond the Wind', 'effect': 'Five-minute ritual + Meditation roll (TN 15) to bless your horse or another rider’s horse. For hours equal to your Earth Ring, the horse suffers no movement penalties based on terrain and does not fatigue. Maximum horses blessed simultaneously equals your Earth Ring.'}]},
    {'name': 'Iuchi Traveler', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja', 'CR'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Iuchi Shugenja 3 or Horiuchi Shugenja 3. Requires: Athletics 2, Horsemanship 2.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Where the Wind Wills', 'effect': 'Spend 1 Void Point and expend 1 Air or Water spell slot (not Void) as a Simple Action to instantly teleport up to School Rank × 100 feet. Affects only you and your carried materials. Expend a second Void Point to also teleport a horse-sized mount you are riding.'}]},
    {'name': 'Moto Fanatic', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Moto Bushi School 4.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Reckless Abandon', 'effect': 'While in Full Attack Stance, spend a Void Point as a Simple Action to gain Reduction equal to your School Rank for as long as you remain in Full Attack Stance.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shinjo Magistrate', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Shinjo Bushi 2, Utaku Battle Maiden 2, Moto Bushi 2, Moto Vindicator 2. Requires: Investigation 3, Lore: Law 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Eyes of the Vigilant', 'effect': '+1k0 to Investigation rolls when locating clues or testing truthfulness. +1k0 to Hunting rolls when tracking known criminals or traitors. +1k0 to all Weapon Skill Rolls when attacking such persons.'}]},
    {'name': 'Shinjo Scout', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi', 'CR'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Moto Bushi 2 or Shinjo Bushi 2. Requires: Stealth 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Swift Soul', 'effect': 'Use the Stealth Skill while on horseback. Treated as having the Way of the Land Advantage no matter where you are. +1k0 to all attack rolls while Mounted.'}]},
    {'name': 'Unicorn Bariqu Wrestler', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Moto Bushi School 2, Shinjo Bushi 2. Requires: Jiujutsu (Bariqu) 3.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Way of the Ujik-Hai', 'effect': 'If your Grapple opponent does not have the Bariqu Emphasis of Jiujutsu, +1k1 when rolling to control the Grapple. If your Agility Rank is higher than your opponent’s in a Grapple, +2k0 when rolling to control the Grapple. Both bonuses stack.'}]},
    {'name': 'Unicorn Doomseeker', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Shugenja'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Iuchi Shugenja 4, Horiuchi Shugenja 4, Moto Death Priest 4. Requires: Willpower 5. Must find a personal teacher who will share the secrets of the Doomseeker tradition.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Path of the Doomseeker', 'effect': 'In the presence of a hidden demon, monster, khadi, or similar entity, roll Willpower (TN 25) to sense its presence and location. If aware of such a creature (by any means), spend a spell slot as a Complex Action to make a Contested Willpower roll: on success, gain one key piece of information about how it can be unmasked or defeated (GM’s choice). Cannot target the same entity more than once per month.'}]},
    {'name': 'Unicorn Wardog Masters', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Shinjo Bushi 4, Utaku Mounted Infantry 4, Moto Bushi 4. Requires: Awareness 3, Willpower 4, Animal Handling (War Dogs) 5. Special: Grants a pack of Unicorn War-Dogs; total pack size equals your Awareness.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Ferocity of the Ki-Rin', 'effect': 'Complex Action: roll Animal Handling (War Dogs)/Willpower (TN 20) to give your entire pack a simple command. Raise for more sophisticated commands (GM’s judgment). When your War-Dogs make attacks you have ordered, they gain +1k0 to attack and damage rolls.'}]},
    {'name': 'Unicorn Yomanri Archer', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': ['Bushi'], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Shinjo Bushi 4, Moto Bushi 4, Moto Vindicator 4, Utaku Battle Maiden 4. Requires: Agility 4, Kyujutsu 5.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'The Way of Yomanri', 'effect': 'With a yumi or dai-kyu, spend one or more consecutive Simple Actions aiming before firing. Each Simple Action awards +1k1 to attack OR +1k0 to damage (your choice per action). Maximum aiming actions cannot exceed your Agility Rank. If interrupted, all aiming benefits are lost. Cannot be used in Center Stance.'}]},
    {'name': 'Utaku Horse Master', 'clan': 'Unicorn', 'category': 'alternate', 'keywords': [], 'benefit': '', 'skills': '', 'honor': '', 'outfit': '', 'affinity': '', 'prereq': 'Replaces: Any Unicorn School 2. Requires: Must be a male of the Utaku family.', 'techniques': [{'rank': 0, 'name': 'Master of the Open Plains', 'effect': '+2k0 to all Animal Handling, Horsemanship, and Hunting rolls.'}]},
